msgstr ""
"Confirm your organization is not yet registered: At the bottom of the page, "
"tick the option indicating that your organization has not yet been "
"registered. The system will then guide you to the next step."

#: templates/become-publisher.html:134
msgid "確認條款及細則，直接三個選項勾選"
msgstr ""
"Accept the terms and conditions: Please review the agreements and tick all "
