msgid "「組織詳情」：單位基本介紹，並附上單位的logo連結"
msgstr ""
"Organization details: Provide a brief introduction to your institution and "
"include a link to your organization logo."

#: templates/become-publisher.html:144
msgid ""
"「認可節點」：若為位於臺灣的單位組織，請維持預設選項，GBIF 秘書處會協助貴單位"
"與TaiBIF團隊聯繫"
msgstr ""
"Endorsing node: If your organization is based in Taiwan, please keep the "
"default suggested option. The GBIF Secretariat will help connect your "
"organization with the TaiBIF team."

#: templates/become-publisher.html:145
msgid "「GBIF 專案」：回答是否曾獲得 GBIF 計畫經費補助"
msgstr ""
"GBIF project: Indicate whether your organization has previously received "
"funding through a GBIF programme or project."

#: templates/become-publisher.html:146
msgid ""
"「聯絡資訊」：可提供 2-3 位窗口，包含行政聯繫與技術聯繫，也可以官方 email 為"
"聯絡方式，以避免因人力轉換而失去聯繫"
msgstr ""
"Contact information: You may provide 2-3 contact persons, including both "
"administrative and technical contacts. A general institutional email address "
"is also recommended to avoid losing contact when staff change."

#: templates/become-publisher.html:147
