msgstr "Chapter 1: Introduction"

#: templates/cookbook-detail-1.html:51
msgid "Pandion haliaetus haliaetus (Linnaeus, 1758) 魚鷹，李豐曉 攝 (CC BY-NC)"
msgstr ""

#: templates/cookbook-detail-1.html:53
