msgstr ""
"Unlike traditional research papers, data papers do not present hypotheses "
"and conclusions."

#: templates/data-paper.html:107
msgid "內容主要為描述作者所開放的資料集相關資訊，"
msgstr ""
"Instead, they primarily describe relevant information about the dataset(s) "
"the author has made publicly available."

#: templates/data-paper.html:108
