"designated authorship information. Users can also exploit the data and "
"materials provided by the contributor to reproduce new work."

#: templates/data-policy.html:90
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        CC BY-NC(CC授權 姓名標示-非商業性)：本授權條款允許使"
