#: templates/data-policy.html:97
msgid ""
"\n"
"                除個別純粹事實性紀錄資訊，依法不受著作權利保護，或另有聲明者"
"外，本網站其餘資料與素材，皆採前列三者擇一之授權或聲明方式提供予公眾使用。依"
"CC0、CC BY、或CC BY-NC，使用者得於商業目的或非商業目的上，不限時間、地域，對"
"所提供之資料進行重製、改作、編輯、公開傳輸，或為其他依法需取得著作授權方可行"
"之之利用。此一授權或宣告行為不會嗣後撤回，使用者亦毋須取得書面或其他方式授"
"權，相關資料與素材亦得依所擇定之授權或聲明方式，經重製、散布，轉至其他託管平"
"台進行公開演播模式之使用，包括但不限於轉引或轉載至全球生物多樣性資訊機構"
"(GBIF)之主資料庫或其他節點提供利用。依CC BY、CC BY-NC授權方式提供者，後續使用"
"時必須註明貢獻者姓名及原始出處，採CC0聲明方式提供者，該公眾領域貢獻宣告並不要"
"求任何顯名義務，然基於學術倫理及科研考據之立場，仍建議使用者於可行狀況，盡量"
"採下列中英文擇一之格式，註解相關資料及素材之貢獻者姓名及原始出處：\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Except for some purely factual record information, which is not protected by "
"copyright at law, or otherwise stated, the rest of the data and materials on "
"this website are provided to the public by one of the three aforementioned "
"licenses and dedication which is CC0, CC BY, and CC BY-NC. Users may "
"reproduce, modify, compile, publicly transmit, and perform other "
"exploitation activities based on the premise of the copyright grant to the "
"data provided for commercial purposes or non-commercial purposes, perpetual "
"and worldwide. This license or dedication is irrevocable, and users do not "
"need to obtain a license deed in writing or otherwise. The provided data and "
"materials can also be reproduced, distributed and transferred to other "
"hosting platforms for public performing utilization under the selected "
"license or dedication method. The granted exploitation includes, but is not "
"limited to, transmitting or transferring to Global Biodiversity data "
"Facility (GBIF) or other nodes for further utilization. If provided under a "
"CC BY or CC BY-NC license method, the contributor’s name and data paternity "
"must be indicated in the subsequent exploitation as recommended format "
"listed below. And if provided under a CC0 dedication method, the public "
"domain dedication does not require any attribution obligation, but it is "
"still encouraged that users can retain the contributor’s name and data "
"paternity as recommended format listed below based on the standpoint of "
"research ethics and scientific accountability. The attribution information "
"can be annotated either in Chinese or English:"

#: templates/data-policy.html:102
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        資料集或資料庫名稱-貢獻者顯名資訊@TaiBIF 臺灣生物多樣"
"性資訊機構-CC BY / CC BY-NC / CC0\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dataset or database title - contributor attribution @TaiBIF Taiwan "
"Biodiversity Information Facility - CC BY / CC BY-NC / CC0"

#: templates/data-policy.html:107
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Title of the Dataset or Database-Contributor’s "
"Attribution@TaiBIF-CC BY / CC BY-NC / CC0\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Title of the Dataset or Database - Contributor’s Attribution @TaiBIF - CC "
"BY / CC BY-NC / CC0"

#: templates/data-policy.html:114
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站所採用之CC授權條款及CC0公眾領域貢獻宣告未指定版本，意即"
"採前列之公眾授權或聲明方式提供使用時，使用者得自行選擇任何 Creative Commons "
"組織發布之授權條款及貢獻宣告版本進行適用，以CC BY為例，使用者得任擇CC BY 3.0 "
"TW或CC BY 4.0授權條款進行利用，若未來CC授權條款或貢獻宣告版本再有更新，使用者"
"亦得採行具同樣授權元素，更新的授權方式進行利用。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The CC license suites and CC0 public domain dedication adopted by this "
"website is not version specified, which means that when the public license "
"or dedication method has been invoked, users can choose any version of the "
"license and dedication published by the Creative Commons organization for "
"applying. Take CC BY as an example, users can choose CC BY 3.0 TW or CC BY "
"4.0 license to apply. And when the CC license suite or dedication is updated "
"on version in the future, users may use the data under the new subsequent "
"license with the same licensing elements."

#: templates/data-policy.html:119
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站對於CC非商業性元素之限制範圍，尊重資料或素材貢獻者及使"
"用者之獨立判斷與自主解釋，並無任何擴大、限縮，或引導之解釋意向。然提醒非商業"
"性元素於不同立場間，或存有寬嚴不一的認定標準與灰色地帶，倘發生司法爭議，本網"
"站當主張法律上網路服務提供者之免責地位，不參與任何一方發動之實體訴訟程序。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website is not intended to expand, limit, or lead the explanation of "
"limitation scope defined by CC non-commercial element, the independent "
"judgment and self-interpretation of the contributors and users of the data "
"or materials shall be equally respected. However, it is reminded that non-"
"commercial element might have different recognition standards in existence "
"and understanding in gray area. In the event of judicial disputes, this "
"website shall assert the exemption status of Internet service providers in "
"the law, and will not participate in any substantive legal proceedings "
"initiated by either party."

#: templates/data-policy.html:126
msgid "相關事項說明"
msgstr "Miscellaneous"

#: templates/data-policy.html:131
msgid ""
"\n"
"                除依照本網站主動提供或應申請提供之資料介接 API 及其使用規範者"
"外，本網站相關服務僅提供自然人使用，禁止其他各種型態或頻率之機械自動化操作。"
"當流量監控管理程式，發現網站系統資源有不正常耗用，並可合理推估其為機械自動化"
"資料或素材捉取行為所致時，本網站將可能中斷或終止對該帳號之後續使用服務。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Except for data that provided initiatively by this website or those who can "
"get access through the API upon permission, the services of this website are "
"only for natural persons use. Other types or frequently mechanical "
"automation operations are prohibited. When the traffic monitoring and "
"management program finds that the website system resources are being used "
"abnormally, and it can be reasonably estimated that it is caused by "
"mechanical automatic data or material extraction, this website may interrupt "
"or terminate the subsequent service of that account."

#: templates/data-policy.html:136
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站對提交之貢獻資料與素材，不負永久露出的維護責任；除此之"
"外，當涉及生物多樣性敏感資料及相近狀況，該資料與素材內含的物種資訊可能造成物"
"種受害，或其他相關環境損害時，本網站得要求貢獻者對資料進行適當遮蔽之後再次上"
"傳，或由本平台協助進行遮蔽濾除之後另行更換。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website is not responsible for maintaining the submitted and "
"contributed materials on public transmitting status permanently. When it "
"comes to biodiversity-sensitive materials or similar situations, in which "
"the species data contained in the materials may cause species damage or "
"related environmental damage, this website may require contributors to "
"properly cover the sensitive data and then upload it again, or the platform "
"may assist in masking and filtering then has the sensitive data replaced."

#: templates/data-policy.html:141
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站於部分頁面提供資料及素材下載功能。關於下載資料與素材之"
"保存，本網站會力求完整維護，惟資料與素材可能因其他因素，如天災、系統錯誤等，"
"而滅失，本網站與維運單位不對前述滅失負任何責任。為避免前述滅失，貢獻者及使用"
"者應自行保留資料與素材之複本。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website provides download function of data and materials on some pages. "
"Regarding the preservation of download function enabled data and materials, "
"this website shall perform due diligence to maintain it completely, but the "
"data and materials may still be lost due to other unexpected causes, such as "
"natural disasters, system errors, and etc … This website and the maintenance "
"unit are not responsible for the aforementioned loss. To avoid the loss "
"explained above, contributors and users should keep copies of the data and "
"materials actively by themselves."

#: templates/data-policy.html:146
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站不會對使用者上傳的貢獻資料與素材進行個案監督，然若該等"
"資料或素材事後為第三方提報檢舉為不合法或不適當，本網站得於合理通知原貢獻者之"
"後，移除相關爭議資料或素材，然當爭議資料與素材涉及侵害他人權利、違反法令、或"
"有公然污辱、謾罵等人身攻擊等不適當資訊嵌入的狀況，本網站得不待通知原貢獻者，"
"立即移除相關資料與素材。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website will not monitor the contributed data and materials uploaded by "
"users on case surveillance. However, if such a data and materials are later "
"reported as unlawful or inappropriate by a third party, this site may remove "
"them in a reasonable time after notification to the original contributors. "
"And when the relevant data and materials in dispute are involving in lawful "
"rights infringement to others, legislation violations, public offense "
"against reputation and credit, personal attack in improper language, and "
"inappropriate information embedded to do so, this website shall immediately "
"remove them without prior notification to the original contributors."

#: templates/data-policy.html:151
msgid ""
"\n"
"                TaiBIF 網站授權範圍僅及於著作權及其相關權利保護之範圍，不及於"
"其他智慧財產權利，包括但不限於專利、商標、及機關標誌或商號圖示之提供。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The scope of license of TaiBIF website is limited to copyright and related "
"rights protection, not extended to other intellectual property rights, which "
"means including but not limited to patent, trademark, organization logo or "
"business mark is not provided."

#: templates/data-policy.html:156
msgid ""
"\n"
"                使用 TaiBIF 網站提供之各項資料與素材，不論其受著作權利保護與"
"否，使用者不得惡意變更其相關資訊，若編輯、改作後所展示之資訊與原不符而造成損"
"害，使用者須自負民事、刑事上之法律責任。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"When using the data and materials provided by the TaiBIF website, whether "
"they are protected by copyright or not, the user shall not maliciously alter "
"the relevant information. If the compiled or adapted information causes "
"damage due to the inconsistency with the original information disclosed, the "
"users shall bear the legal responsibility by themselves in civil and "
"criminal matters."

#: templates/data-policy.html:161
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站並不擔保所提供資料與素材之正確性及合用性，使用者利用本"
"網站無償提供之各項資料與素材，受有損害或損失，或致第三人受有損害或損失，除法"
"令另有規定外，本網站及其維運單位，依CC授權條款及CC0公眾領域宣告之免責聲明，主"
"張法律容許限度下最高的免責範圍，不負任何賠償或補償之責。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website does not guarantee correctness and fitness of the data and "
"materials provided. If users suffer damage or loss, or cause damage or loss "
"to a third party due to the utilization of data and materials provided by "
"this website on a free-of-charge basis, unless otherwise stipulated at law, "
"this website and its maintenance unit, complying with the Disclaimer of "
"Warranties and Limitation of Liability statement of CC license and CC0 "
"public domain dedication, claim to the maximum extent permitted by "
"applicable law a disclaimer, to not liable for any indemnification or "
"compensation thereof."

#: templates/data-policy.html:169
msgid ""
"臺灣生物多樣性資訊機構 (Taiwan Biodiversity Information Facility, TaiBIF) 隱"
"私權政策"
msgstr "TaiBIF Privacy Policy"

#: templates/data-policy.html:179
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本處所述隱私權政策，適用於貢獻者及使用者在 TaiBIF 網站活動"
"時，所涉及有關個人資料的蒐集、處理及利用，包括但不限於會員註冊服務、洽詢維運"
"團隊進行意見互動、資料與素材貢獻，以及網路資訊瀏覽等使用行為。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The privacy policy stated here applies to the personal data collection, "
"processing, and utilization for the contributors and users’ activities "
"involved in the usage of the TaiBIF website, including but not limited to "
"membership registration services, consultation with the maintenance team for "
"opinions exchange, contribution of data and materials, and website "
"information browsing."

#: templates/data-policy.html:184
msgid ""
"\n"
"                使用者持續使用 TaiBIF 網站服務，即視為當事人明示同意下述之資"
"料蒐集、處理，及利用方式。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Users who continue to use TaiBIF website services are deemed to have agreed "
"to the following data collection, processing, and utilization methods."

#: templates/data-policy.html:191
msgid "TaiBIF 蒐集使用者資料"
msgstr "Personal Data collected"

#: templates/data-policy.html:196
msgid ""
"\n"
"                使用者登錄本網站服務之相關帳號時，自主填註的各項個人識別資"
"料，包括姓名、電郵、以及服務單位，僅作為認證、授權標示，與相關通知、聯繫之"
"用。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"When a user logs into the relevant account of this website service, the "
"personal data being provided initiatively shall be collected, including "
"name, email, and service unit, however will only be used for membership "
"identification, contribution license labeling for authorship, and for "
"related notification and contact."

#: templates/data-policy.html:201
msgid ""
"\n"
"                TaiBIF使用新版Google分析(GA4)與Google代碼管理工具(GTM)進行流"
"量分析及程式管理。相關流量分析與管理工具，有助於協助網站和應用程式管理者，掌"
"握訪客與網站和應用程式的互動情形。新版Google分析並不直接從使用者的終端設備進"
"行Cookies資訊的收集，僅透過浮動式的使用者代號，紀錄該代號於本網站上之使用行"
"為，此等數據資訊之收集，僅供管理端分析流量及觀測網站服務之用。本平台亦不透過"
"使用行為的紀錄，識別個別訪客的個人身分或紀錄使用者的真實IP位址。若使用者希望"
"確保相關使用資訊不被收集，亦得於瀏覽器調校安全層級，或自設資訊屏蔽機制(Do "
"Not Track)。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The TaiBIF platform utilizes the latest version of Google Analytics (GA4) "
"and Google Tag Manager (GTM) for traffic analysis and program management. "
"These tools assist website and application administrators in understanding "
"interactions between visitors and their sites or apps. The new version of "
"Google Analytics does not collect cookie information directly from users' "
"devices. Instead, it tracks user behavior through a floating user ID on this "
"website. This data collection is solely for traffic analysis and website "
"service monitoring by the management team. Additionally, the platform does "
"not use behavioral records to identify individual visitors or capture users' "
"actual IP addresses. If users wish to prevent their information from being "
"collected, they can adjust their browser security settings or implement "
"information blocking mechanisms (Do Not Track)."

#: templates/data-policy.html:206
msgid ""
"\n"
"                貢獻者提供資料與素材，所記錄或內嵌之地理位置，相關資訊僅用於"
"生物資訊之顯示、分析與彙整。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The related information of geographic locations, which is recorded or "
"embedded in the contributed data and materials, shall be collected, and is "
"only used for the display, analysis and compilation purpose of biological "
"data."

#: templates/data-policy.html:211
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站採CC授權條款及CC0公眾領域貢獻宣告來吸納貢獻，當貢獻者提"
"供資料或素材之顯名資訊，涉及個人資料之描述時，該等個人資料視為當事人自行公開"
"之個人資料，依個人資料相關法令之規範，後續蒐集處理毋須再經當事人書面同意，該"
"等資料之提供使用範圍，將用於支持科學資料有效驗證之公益目的。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website adopts CC license and CC0 public domain dedication to receive "
"contributions. When contributors provide data or materials involving the "
"personal data description in the authorship attribution, such personal data "
"shall be regarded as making public by the data subjects themselves. "
"According to the personal data protection act and regulations, the "
"subsequent collection and processing for those personal data does not "
"require an additional written consent of the data subjects, and hence "
"rendering those personal data utilization scope as being reached for the "
"purpose of scientific data verification support for public good."

#: templates/data-policy.html:216
msgid ""
"\n"
"                本網站得將貢獻者提交之內容，依其指定之授權或宣告方式推送至其"
"他平台，包括但不限於轉引或轉載至全球生物多樣性資訊機構(GBIF)之主資料庫或其他"
"節點，或推送至臉書、推特等社群網路平台，此一推送模式涉及個人資料之國際傳輸，"
"於推送後就該平台之個人資料使用事宜，轉依該平台依其隱私權政策進行處理。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This website may push the content submitted by contributors forward to other "
"platforms under the designated license or dedication methods selected by the "
"contributors, including but not limited to transmitting or transferring to "
"Global Biodiversity data Facility (GBIF) or other nodes, or push forward to "
"other social media network platforms such as Facebook and Twitter. This push "
"mode might involve the cross-border transfer of personal data, and when the "
"personal data has been pushed, the further use of those transferred personal "
"data shall be managed in accordance with the received platform’s privacy "
"policy."

#: templates/data-policy.html:223
msgid "TaiBIF 對相關資料之去識別化與量化處理"
msgstr ""
"TaiBIF’s de-identification and quantification of relevant personal data"

#: templates/data-policy.html:228
msgid ""
"\n"
"                貢獻者同意 TaiBIF 得以對其回報資料與素材，進行合理妥適之去識"
"別化或相關數據量化的處理。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Contributors agree that TaiBIF shall be able to process the de-"
"identification or quantification disposal to the personal data involving in "
"the data and materials they reported, in a reasonable and appropriate manner."

#: templates/data-policy.html:233
msgid ""
"\n"
"                處理後的資料、素材，與其貢獻者或其他當事人個人識別狀態無法產"
"生連結者，便不再屬於個人資料，後續將得以不受回報目的之限制，被進行利用。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The processed data and materials, which cannot be linked to the personal "
"identification of their contributors or other data subjects, are no longer "
"personal data, and shall be able to use in the subsequent exploitation "
"without restriction within the reported purpose."

#: templates/data-policy.html:240
msgid "隱私權保護政策修訂"
msgstr "Privacy Policy Amendment"

#: templates/data-policy.html:245
msgid ""
"\n"
"                TaiBIF 將不定時修訂本項政策，以符合最新的個人資料與相關法定權"
"利之保護規範。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"TaiBIF shall revise this policy from time to time to comply with the latest "
"personal data act and related lawful rights protection regulations."

#: templates/data-policy.html:250
msgid ""
"\n"
"                隱私權政策經修訂後，將透過 IPT 資料發布工具的會員註冊時提供的"
"聯繫電郵主動通知，亦會於本網站「最新消息」分類項下進行公告。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"When the Privacy Policy is updated, it will be proactively notified through "
"the contact email provided by members of the IPT data Publishing Tool when "
"registering, and will also be announced under the “Latest News” category of "
"this website."

#: templates/data-policy.html:255
msgid ""
"\n"
"                使用者對 TaiBIF 網站服務的繼續使用，視為明示同意更新版本的隱"
"私權政策。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"By subsequently using TaiBIF website service, a user indicates his/her "
"acceptance of the updated version of the privacy policy."

#: templates/data-policy.html:262
msgid "回報機制"
msgstr "Request Mechanism"

#: templates/data-policy.html:267
msgid ""
"\n"
"                TaiBIF 對於相關資料的收集，已踐履個人資料保護法及其相關法規的"
"基礎要求，並在資料的處理及利用上，透過彙整或去識別化流程，以強化使用者的隱私"
"防護。相關資料在處理之後，將提供科學研究目的之分享。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"TaiBIF has fulfilled the fundamental requirements of the Personal Data "
"Protection Act and related regulations for the collection of relevant data, "
"and has enhanced the privacy protection of users through the procedures of "
"compilation or de-identification in the processing and utilization practice "
"of data. When the relevant data has been well processed, it will be shared "
"for scientific research purposes."

#: templates/data-policy.html:272
msgid ""
"\n"
"                若網站服務的使用者或資料素材之貢獻者，對於當事人自身之個人資"
"料有隱私疑慮，請透過網站公告資訊聯絡維運團隊，相關當事人若對自身之個人資料有"
"進行查閱、更正、停止利用，以及刪除的意見與要求，亦可透過網站回報機制進行提"
"報，本網站之維運團隊，將於確認收受提交意見，並完成人別確認後，三十日內進行妥"
"善處理。\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"If the user of the website service or the contributor of the data and "
"material has privacy concerns about the personal data of him/her as the data "
"subject, please contact the maintenance team through the website contact "
"information. Opinions and requests for reviewing, correcting, cessation of "
"utilization, and erasing to the data subject’s own personal data involved, "
"can also be reported through the website Request Mechanism. The maintenance "
"team of this website shall properly manage the request within 30 days, after "
"the submitted opinions has been further clarified and the data subject "
"identity has been well confirmed."

