msgid "資料產品"
msgstr "Data Products"

#: templates/data-product.html:38 templates/data-product.html:47
msgid "什麼是「資料產品」？"
msgstr "What is Data Product?"

#: templates/data-product.html:39 templates/data-product.html:111
msgid "資料下載API"
