#: templates/data-product.html:49
msgid "TL;DR 最直接，簡短的定義："
msgstr "TL;DR, the most direct and concise definition:"

#: templates/data-product.html:50
msgid "主要目的為使用資料來實現特定目標的產品"
msgstr ""
"A data product is a product designed to achieve specific goals through the "
"use of data."

#: templates/data-product.html:53
msgid "長一點的定義是："
msgstr "A longer definition is:"

#: templates/data-product.html:54
msgid ""
"資料產品是使用資料處理、分析或技術製作以資料為核心的成果，其設計目的是為了提"
"供具有價值的資訊或見解來實現目標。"
msgstr ""
"A data product is a data-centric output created using data processing, "
"analysis, or technology. Its primary purpose is to provide valuable "
"information or insights to achieve objectives."

#: templates/data-product.html:57
msgid ""
"\n"
"                為什麼需要資料產品呢？ 在TaiBIF團隊進行授課的過程中，發現許多"
"學員對於如何應用開放資料很有興趣，但是！在開始應用之前，你真的充分了解你所下"
"載的資料嗎？\n"
"                所以，資料產品的開發是<strong>為了降低資料使用者在使用資料時"
"的門檻</strong>，這包括協助資料使用者加強理解、支持決策的制定或優化工作上的流"
"程。\n"
"                而在生物多樣性資訊學領域中，資料產品是利用資料的力量來理解並"
"引導管理與保護工作，而資料產品可以是以下的形式：\n"
"                生物多樣性資料庫（如出現紀錄或基因資訊等）、遙感探測圖、生物"
"多樣性指標計算工具、物種分布模型、資料分析與視覺化工具等等，絕對是保護地球上"
"生命多樣性的重要工具們！\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Why do we need data products? Data products are essential tools for "
"protecting the diversity of life on Earth. TaiBIF's teaching experiences "
"indicate that many students are interested in data applications. However, it "
"is crucial to understand the data you downloaded before using it. The "
"development of data products aims to reduce the barriers for data users by "
"assisting them in enhancing their understanding, supporting decision-making, "
"or optimizing workflow processes. In the field of biodiversity informatics, "
"data products utilize the power of data to understand and guide management "
"and conservation efforts. Data products can take various forms, including "
"biodiversity databases (such as occurrence records or genetic information), "
"remote sensing maps, biodiversity indicator calculation tools, species "
"distribution models, data analysis and visualization tools, etc. They are "
"essential tools for protecting the diversity of life on Earth!"

