#: templates/find-data.html:30
msgid ""
"是全球最大的開放生物多樣性資料平台之一，由各國政府與合作機構共同支持，致力於"
"整合來自世界各地的物種觀察紀錄、館藏標本資料、環境調查成果與相關研究資訊。使"
"用者可透過網站搜尋全球的物種分布、下載資料集、瀏覽資料視覺化成果。GBIF.org 同"
"時提供資料發布機制與技術標準，協助各國機構將在地資料連結至全球網絡，促進國際"
"合作與知識共享。"
msgstr ""
"GBIF.org is one of the world’s largest open biodiversity data platforms, "
"supported by governments and partner institutions worldwide. It is dedicated "
"to integrating species occurrence records, museum and herbarium specimen "
"data, environmental survey results, and related research information from "
"across the globe. Users can search species distributions, download datasets, "
"and explore data visualizations for use. GBIF.org also provides data "
"publishing infrastructure and technical standards that help institutions "
"connect local biodiversity data to a global network, fostering international "
"collaboration and knowledge sharing."

#: templates/find-data.html:37
msgid "TBIA 生物多樣性資料庫共通查詢系統"
msgstr "Taiwan Biodiversity Database Portal"

#: templates/find-data.html:40
msgid ""
"為臺灣生物多樣性資訊聯盟（TBIA）建置的生物多樣性資料入口網站，整合臺灣學術研"
"究單位、各大博物館及自然史典藏單位、政府單位，與部分企業、民間團體所提供的生"
"態與物種資料，提供一站式查詢與應用服務。網站聚焦臺灣在地需求，使用者可快速查"
"找臺灣物種分布、觀測紀錄與相關資料來源，作為生態研究、保育管理、環境評估及教"
"育推廣的重要基礎。透過跨單位資料串聯與標準化整合，tbiadata.tw 致力於提升臺灣"
"生物多樣性資料的可近性與實際應用價值。"
msgstr ""
"This is the biodiversity data portal established by the Taiwan Biodiversity "
"Information Alliance (TBIA), integrating ecological and species data "
"contributed by Taiwanese research institutions, natural history "
"institutions, public sectors, private sectors, and citizen science projects. "
"It offers a one-stop platform for data discovery and application. Users can "
"efficiently access information on species distributions, observation "
"records, and related data sources in Taiwan, supporting ecological research, "
"conservation management, environmental assessment, and education. Through "
"cross-institutional data integration and standardized exchange, tbiadata.tw "
"aims to enhance the accessibility and practical value of Taiwan’s "
"biodiversity data."

