#: templates/tools.html:46
msgid ""
"生物多樣性資料校對轉換工具為 TaiBIF 資訊團隊研發，目前提供學名檢查、中文名批"
"次比對與座標轉換。本研究目前由中研院「台灣生物多樣性資訊平台之學術、社會推廣"
"與國際接軌」、國科會「建置與維護及整合臺灣生物多樣性資訊國家入口網 (TaiBIF) "
"及與 GBIF 接軌」及林務局「生態資源資料庫分組整合推動計畫」等計畫經費支持。"
msgstr ""
"The Biodiversity Data Validation and Conversion Tool was developed by the "
"TaiBIF information team. It currently provides scientific name checking, "
"batch Chinese common name matching, and coordinate conversion. This work is "
"supported by Academia Sinica's \"Taiwan Biodiversity Information Facility: "
"Academic and Social Outreach and International Alignment\" project, the "
"National Science and Technology Council's \"Development, Maintenance, and "
"Integration of the Taiwan Biodiversity Information Facility (TaiBIF) and "
"Alignment with GBIF\" project, and the Forestry Bureau's \"Ecological "
"Resource Database Integration Promotion Project.\""

#: templates/tools.html:47
msgid ""
"有鑑於過去物種生態分布之地理座標系統不同，造成整合地理資訊上之困難，及物種於"
"地圖上標記之錯誤，因此本系統可提供線上地理座標資訊，以便使用者更新老舊生態分"
"布之資料，得以進一步比較分析與研究，系統提供 WGS 84、TM2 67 與 TM2 97 三種格"
"式之間的相互轉換。"
msgstr ""
"Because species distribution records have historically used different "
"geographic coordinate systems, integrating spatial information can be "
"difficult and species may be mapped incorrectly. This system provides online "
"coordinate conversion so users can update older ecological distribution data "
"for further comparison, analysis, and research. It supports conversion among "
"WGS 84, TM2 67, and TM2 97."

#: templates/tools.html:49
msgid "座標轉換"
msgstr "Coordinate Conversion"

#: templates/tools.html:54 templates/tools.html:61
msgid "學名與物種中文名比對"
msgstr "Scientific Name and Chinese Common Name Matching"

#: templates/tools.html:57
msgid ""
"由<a href=\"https://taicol.tw/zh-hant/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">臺灣物種名錄</a>（TaiCOL）提供，使用者可批次貼入學名與中文名進行"
"比對，得到對應的物種有效學名與物種編號。支援跨生物界與各分類階層的比對，並允"
"許使用者根據需求調整查詢設定。（比對來源為TaiCOL）"
msgstr ""
"Provided by the <a href=\"https://taicol.tw/zh-hant/\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Taiwan Catalogue of Life</a> (TaiCOL), this tool "
"allows users to paste scientific names and Chinese common names in batches "
"for matching, and returns the corresponding accepted scientific names and "
"species IDs. It supports matching across kingdoms and taxonomic ranks, and "
"allows users to adjust query settings as needed. (Matching source: TaiCOL)"

#: templates/tools.html:66
msgid "有效學名比對"
msgstr "Accepted Scientific Name Matching"

#: templates/tools.html:69
msgid ""
"物種在分類學上往往存在同物異名，本工具提供批次的物種學名比對，可提供該學名是"
"否為有效學名及物種代碼等相關資訊，比對來源包含GBIF、COL、TBN與TaiCOL等。"
msgstr ""
"Synonyms are common in taxonomy. This tool provides batch scientific name "
"matching and returns information such as whether each name is accepted and "
"its species code. Matching sources include GBIF, COL, TBN, and TaiCOL."

#: templates/tools.html:76
msgid "GBIF 資料驗證工具"
msgstr "GBIF Data Validator"

#: templates/tools.html:79
msgid ""
"為全球生物多樣性資訊機構 GBIF 所開發的網頁版資料驗證工具，可將文字檔或excel上"
"傳，並顯示資料檔案中的資料問題及錯誤之處。上傳的資料檔案欄位須符合 DwC，使用"
"前亦須先登入GBIF會員（可用google帳號註冊）。"
msgstr ""
"A web-based data validation tool developed by the Global Biodiversity "
"Information Facility (GBIF). Users can upload text files or Excel files to "
"identify issues and errors in their data. Uploaded data fields must follow "
"Darwin Core (DwC), and users must sign in with a GBIF account before use "
"(Google accounts can be used to register)."

#: templates/tools.html:86
msgid "數位 TaiBIFer"
msgstr "Digital TaiBIFer"

#: templates/tools.html:89
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    提供全天候協助的數位 TaiBIFer，隨時為您解答有關生物多樣性"
"領域開放資料的相關問題。本服務由大型語言模型支援，旨在即時提供協助與建議，惟"
"部分內容可能受限於模型訓練資料與推論方式，建議在應用前多方查證以確保資訊準確"
"性。\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The Digital TaiBIFer is a 24/7 helpdesk, ready to answer your questions "
"about biodiversity open data. This service is supported by a large language "
"model and is designed to provide real-time assistance and advice. However, "
"some of the content may be limited by the model's training data and "
"inference methods, and it is recommended to verify the information before "
"use to ensure its accuracy."

#: templates/tools.html:101
msgid ""
"TaiBIF Open Data Toolkit 是一個專門針對生物多樣性資料整合的工具，採用了國際生"
"物多樣性領域常用的 Darwin Core 資料標準， 旨在幫助使用者建立並有效管理、編"
"輯、驗證和清理生物多樣性資料集。若想要建立資料模板、資料編輯管理和發布，此工"
"具將能引導您進入理想的資料管理流程，並協助管控資料品質。"
msgstr ""
"The TaiBIF Open Data Toolkit is designed specifically for biodiversity data "
"integration. It uses Darwin Core, a widely adopted international data "
"standard in the biodiversity field, to help users create, manage, edit, "
"validate, and clean biodiversity datasets. For users who need to create data "
"templates, manage and edit data, or publish datasets, this tool guides them "
"through a practical data management workflow and helps control data quality."

